From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jim Martin <jimmartin@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 13:41:02 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: clock: qcom: Add Glymur GCC USB4 PHY and DP0 PHY
 resets

The Glymur GCC has block resets for the three USB4 PHYs and for the DP0
PHYs of the second and third USB4 instances that the binding does not
define yet. Add their indices, after the existing ones.

Assisted-by: Opus 5.5
Signed-off-by: Jim Martin <jimmartin@gmail.com>
---
 include/dt-bindings/clock/qcom,glymur-gcc.h | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/include/dt-bindings/clock/qcom,glymur-gcc.h b/include/dt-bindings/clock/qcom,glymur-gcc.h
index 6907653c799..22f6e23747d 100644
--- a/include/dt-bindings/clock/qcom,glymur-gcc.h
+++ b/include/dt-bindings/clock/qcom,glymur-gcc.h
@@ -576,4 +576,10 @@
 #define GCC_VIDEO_BCR						91
 #define GCC_VIDEO_AXI0C_CLK_ARES				92
 
+#define GCC_USB4PHY_0_PHY_PRIM_BCR				93
+#define GCC_USB4PHY_1_PHY_SEC_BCR				94
+#define GCC_USB4PHY_2_PHY_TERT_BCR				95
+#define GCC_USB4_1_DP0_PHY_SEC_BCR				96
+#define GCC_USB4_2_DP0_PHY_TERT_BCR				97
+
 #endif
-- 
2.56.0

